{"asset_key":"ep7/env_story_17323590","episode":"ep7","category":"env_story","story_id":"17323590","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1732359001:1":{"text":"저희가 직접 만들어서 팔면 아마 그렇겠죠. 하지만 상회에 가입했거든요.","source_cn":"要是交给我们自产自销那确实很可能卖不完，但我们加入了行会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A1029A8A2EB41C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1732359002:1":{"text":"맞아요. 상회가 물건도 조율도 해주고, 사바나 전체에 골고루 상품을 공급해 줘요.","source_cn":"没错，行会不但会给我们生产多少货物的建议，会将我们做的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D6B5B53263B41BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1732359003:1":{"text":"그런데 이번 고대의 전당 사건은 너무 갑작스러워서... 상회에도 영향이 있을지 모르겠네요.","source_cn":"可这次圣古堂的事情太突然了，我害怕行会的分发销售也会受...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96ADDFC4C28CE9A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:手工业者卡拉":{"text":"수공업자 카라","source":"手工业者卡拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:手工业者奇科普":{"text":"수공업자 치코푸","source":"手工业者奇科普","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:手工业者莉娜":{"text":"수공업자 리나","source":"手工业者莉娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":3}}